fore insufficient to confirm a time-respecting cascade under the 600-unit constraint."}, "raw_final_response": "{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_b01bcb3b\",\n  \"decision\": \"insufficient\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1800, 1115],\n  \"window\": [48286, 86685],\n  \"confidence\": 0.75,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"There is a plausible two-step route 1800 -> 36 -> 1115 within the window (steps 07,08) and both interactions occur in the later subwindow (steps 13,15) when overall activity is concentrated (step 16). However, the available queries do not provide the exact timestamps needed to verify that the 36->1115 interaction happened after the 1800->36 interaction and within the 600-time-unit tolerance. There is no direct 1800->1115 event (step 03), and both nodes are fairly active (steps 02,04,06), so coincidence is possible. Temporal evidence is therefore insufficient to confirm a time-respecting cascade under the 600-unit constraint.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 113700, "total_output_tokens": 8809, "total_tokens": 122509, "total_latency_ms": 119673, "llm_calls": 17, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}